{"seq":25,"slug":"xiaomi","title":"小米企业文化与管理哲学","stage":"DONE","category":"corporate-management","chapterCount":7,"docCount":26,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi","rating":{"composite":4.03,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.11,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"小米企业文化与管理哲学-简介\">小米企业文化与管理哲学 简介</h1><p>小米集团自 2010 年创立以来，凭借独特的互联网思维和管理模式，从一家初创企业成长为全球市值超万亿的科技巨头。创始人雷军以&quot;专注、极致、口碑、快&quot;七字诀为核心方法论，构建了一套融合工程师文化、用户共创与扁平化管理的企业运营体系，成为中国商业史上的经典案例。</p>\n<p>本知识库系统梳理小米在企业文化、绩效管理、组织人才、战略方法论、职级薪酬、职业发展和 AI 转型七个维度的实践经验，适合企业管理者、创业者、求职者、组织研究者以及对互联网思维管理模式感兴趣的读者。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>文化与价值观</strong>深入解读小米的核心文化基因——从&quot;专注极致口碑快&quot;七字诀到参与感文化，再到&quot;和用户交朋友&quot;的企业愿景，以及使命演变、雷军创业哲学、核心价值观体系和文化扩展的全景分析。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>绩效体系</strong>剖析小米独特的扁平化考核方式、去 KPI 化实践，以及工程师驱动的评价机制，揭示这种非传统绩效管理为何能激发组织活力。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>组织与人才</strong>聚焦小米的合伙人制度、生态链投资模式和工程师文化，解析如何通过制度设计吸引和留住顶尖人才。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>战略与方法论</strong>解读小米&quot;铁人三项&quot;商业模式、极致性价比方法论以及造车转型的战略决策，展示小米如何在不同发展阶段持续进化。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>职级与薪酬体系</strong>全面解析小米 13—22 级十级职级体系、各级别薪酬带宽与股权激励方案，以及绩效评估机制和职场生存指南，为求职者和在职员工提供实用参考。</p>\n<p>第六章<strong>岗位与职业路径</strong>为工程师、产品经理、硬件设计师和运营零售人才提供详细的成长地图，覆盖 HyperOS、汽车、AI 大模型等七大技术方向和多个业务岗位的逐级晋升路径。</p>\n<p>第七章<strong>AI 转型</strong>分析小米在 AI 领域的全面布局——从小爱同学到 MiMo 大模型、从自动驾驶到智能制造，解读 AI 战略对各岗位的影响以及员工的 AI 实践路径。</p>\n<p>建议读者从第一章开始，理解小米文化底层逻辑后，再深入绩效和组织层面的具体实践，通过战略章节把握全局视野，最后结合职级、职业路径和 AI 转型章节制定个人发展策略。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-and-values","title":"文化与价值观","docCount":7,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/culture-and-values","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"seven-principles","title":"七字诀：专注极致口碑快","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/culture-and-values/seven-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"participation-sense","title":"参与感文化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/culture-and-values/participation-sense"},{"seq":3,"slug":"user-friendship","title":"和用户交朋友","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/culture-and-values/user-friendship"},{"seq":4,"slug":"mission-vision-evolution","title":"小米使命与愿景演变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/culture-and-values/mission-vision-evolution"},{"seq":5,"slug":"leijun-philosophy","title":"雷军的创业哲学与管理风格","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/culture-and-values/leijun-philosophy"},{"seq":6,"slug":"core-values-system","title":"小米核心价值观体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/culture-and-values/core-values-system"},{"seq":7,"slug":"culture-expansion","title":"从手机到 IoT 到汽车的文化扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/culture-and-values/culture-expansion"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-system","title":"绩效体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/performance-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"flat-assessment","title":"扁平化考核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/performance-system/flat-assessment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"de-kpi","title":"去 KPI 化实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/performance-system/de-kpi"},{"seq":3,"slug":"engineer-driven","title":"工程师驱动的评价体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/performance-system/engineer-driven"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"org-and-talent","title":"组织与人才","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/org-and-talent","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"partner-system","title":"合伙人制度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/org-and-talent/partner-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ecosystem-chain","title":"生态链投资模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/org-and-talent/ecosystem-chain"},{"seq":3,"slug":"engineering-culture","title":"工程师文化与人才观","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/org-and-talent/engineering-culture"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"strategy-and-methodology","title":"战略与方法论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/xiaomi/strategy-and-method